      "message": "Thanks Jakub. This (either take both, MTL and RTN, from local QoS settings OR remote preferred) is exactly what we are doing with our latest patchset.\n\nHope you are just confirming that the behavior will resolve issue with test device. Do let us know in case you have any further concern/suggestion.",
